      "Language": "spa",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We report a new case of intestinal duplication in a child of two years old with acute abdomen. At the laparotomy was found to be due to tubular duplication ascending colon. A resection duplication joined a tract of normal colon where are was performed, with termino-terminal anastomosis. The postoperative course was excellent."},
